A smart OFW knows how important it is to use hard-earn money well. Join us and build your dreams, retire early, and learn how to invest.','excerpt' => '','featured_image' => 'blog_news/uploads/2017/05/18620366_10211676363838801_5946053170143347683_n.jpg','views' => '51','category_id' => '9','published_at' => '2017-05-25 10:54:56','created_at' => '2026-01-07 02:04:20','updated_at' => '2026-01-07 02:13:52'),
  array('id' => '181','title' => 'Filipino Homes Goes to Singapore','slug' => 'filipino-homes-goes-singapore','content' => '<h1>Filipino Homes held a Philippine Property Roadshow in Singapore last May 27 to 28, 2017.</h1>
The roadshow was participated by the Filipino Homes members from Cebu, Cagayan de Oro City, Bacolod City and Dumaguete City. It was held at 334 D King George Building King George Avenue Singapore. Together with the Filipino Homes members was the team of Cebu Landmasters  Inc. The team catered to our overseas Filipino Workers based in Singapore. Investment opportunities in Cebu City, Iloilo City, Davao City, Dumaguete City, Bacolod City, Naga City and Cagayan de Oro City were presented for investment.

<a href="http://filipinohomes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/CEBU-LANDMASTERS-PROJECTS-IN-CEBU.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1950" src="http://filipinohomes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/CEBU-LANDMASTERS-PROJECTS-IN-CEBU.jpg" alt="" width="848" height="315" /></a>

Cebu Landmasters Inc. partnered with Filipino Homes in their property roadshows to take care of the rental and property management of the properties invested by their clients.

