<iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/MpntnVYwK5E?rel=0&amp;controls=0&amp;showinfo=0" width="560" height="315" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe>

The joint venture, El Camino Developers Cebu, Inc., will bring you to a high-rise, top-class, New York-inspired condominium situated in a retail plaza and open park at the Cebu IT Park in Lahug, Cebu City.It will also feature a garden atrium, lounge areas, and sky gardens on various floors. The sky club amenity deck will have a swimming pool, fitness gym, lounge areas and a multi-function hall.
<h3 style="text-align: justify;">2. Brentwood Condominium</h3>
