<p style="text-align: justify;">Primary Homes, Inc. will take you a walk in its first garden walk-up condominium in Basak, Lapu-Lapu City, Cebu. Following the success of PrimaryHomes\' Courtyards series, Brentwood is strategically located near Gaisano Grand Mall, Mactan Doctors Hospital, Mactan-Cebu International Airport (MCIA), hotels and five-star beach resorts.</p>

<h3 style="text-align: justify;">3. Woodlands Resort Communities</h3>
