<p style="text-align: justify;">Duros Land Properties Inc. launched a P5-billion resort project known as The Woodlands, a 10-hectare development with five residential towers and several villas located in Upper Yati, Liloan. Inside The Woodlands is the <em>One Tectona Condominium</em> that will have 14 levels with 165 residential units and 21 duplex villas, is envisioned to be a refreshing and vibrant home for Japanese retirees and a time-share property for business and leisure travelers who want a quick getaway.</p>

<h3 style="text-align: justify;">4. Bria Flats Mactan</h3>
<img class="size-large" src="http://www.cebuhousing.net/images/bria%20flats%20mactan%20image.jpg" alt="bria flats mactan filipino homes xyza yape" width="1091" height="818" />
<p style="text-align: justify;">Bria Flats’ 4 story walk-up condominiums located in Sudtunggan, Baska, Lapu-Lapu City, Cebu brings you to a nature-inspired terrain that will satisfy your vacation goals as life made easier with its proximity to the soon-to-be-built Mactan-Cordova Bridge that will connect Mactan to Shell Island to Cebu City.Designed to highlight affordable modern city living, Bria Flats Mactan houses efficiently designed studio units in 21 building clusters. It also features guardhouse, covered walk, tree-lined avenues, multi-purpose hall, function room, kiddie and adult swimming pool, gazebo and playground, play court, and jogging path.</p>

<h3 style="text-align: justify;">5. Minglanilla Highlands</h3>
<img class="size-large" src="http://filipinohomes.com/members/1179/listing/6828/1179-6828-1515943138.jpg" alt="minglanilla highlands best investment cebu xyzayape" width="1024" height="768" />
<p style="text-align: justify;">Sterling Land Residences and Development, Inc. poised over P2-billion in the next 14 years to develop a 25-hectare hilltop community in Tubod, Minglanilla for a luxury mountain resort. It will feature townhouses, duplex, and single detached units, as well as a portion of the Minglanilla Lifestyle Hubspot where major institutional amenities like a religious shrine, a wedding chapel, and a mountain resort clubhouse will be located</p>

<h3 style="text-align: justify;">6.Mandani Bay Quay</h3>
<img class="size-large" src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IQEBiqR9l9s/maxresdefault.jpg" alt="mandani bay quay cebu investment filipino homes xyza yape" width="1280" height="720" />
<p style="text-align: justify;">HTLand, with a joint venture between Hong Kong Land and Cebu-based Taft Properties, will set a new benchmark for a P12-billion modern seafront destination and residential communities within the Mandani Bay complex, Mandaue City. Among the Mandani Bay Quay’s amenities is the Active Zone, located right in the middle of the property’s enclave, which is exclusive to residents of Mandani Bay. It will feature a 50-meter lap pool, cabanas, a clubhouse, multi-purpose court, a sports hall, adventure playground and an outdoor fitness facility. It also features one-bedroom and two-bedroom units, two-bedroom and three-bedroom suites, three-bedroom penthouse units and garden units that come with private gardens ideal for al fresco dining.</p>

<h3 style="text-align: justify;">7. Garden Bloom Villas  South</h3>
<img class="wp-image-2404 size-full" src="http://filipinohomes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/23032558_333480873785914_9217220095032697088_n-2-e1509813207585.jpg" alt="garden bloom minglanilla" width="676" height="367" />
<p style="text-align: justify;">Garden Bloom Villa South is a new economic type housing project of Primary Homes Inc. It is available for pre-selling this year 2018. The property occupies 2.14 hectares of land and designed to have 292 two-story townhouses available for all interested Filipinos in the country. Located in Pakigne, Minglanilla Cebu.  Please note that prices may change without prior notice. For an updated price range and availability please contact me or any Filipino Homes Agent to assist you.</p>

<h3>8. J Tower Residences</h3>
<img class="size-large" src="http://mphrealtycebu.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/j-tower1.jpg" width="1280" height="720" />

An iconic landmark in vertical development is about to unfold bringing exceptional standards in leisure living, lifestyle, shopping, and an exciting community where proximity is a privilege. A New residential tower to rise at the heart of Mandaue City With Direct Access JCentre Mall. The condo is packed with unlimited amenities. It has an access to Gold’s Gym, Sky Waterpark, SM Supermarket, 4 resto bars, 400 shops of a major mall and many more! It is located along the road and has the access to all types of Transportation. Developed by Mr. Justin Uy. The Owner of J Centre Mall and J Park.
<h3>9. Casa Mira South</h3>
<iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/fl9d_rsTEiA?rel=0&amp;controls=0&amp;showinfo=0" width="560" height="315" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe>Cebu Landmasters proudly presents to you a modern Filipino community, located at Langtad, City of Naga, Cebu - CASA MIRA SOUTH. Take a look at this video and see why we call it a Mira-cle! More space, more amenities, more value. Casa Mira South - More for the Filipino Family.
<h3>10. Amberly Subdivision</h3>
