<span style="font-weight: 400;">A 3-tower residential condominium boasting of a blooming green sanctuary that will soon to rise in the heart of the city. Built in 2 phases, each building has 15 floors adjacent to each other creating a tranquil hideaway after a long busy day. Enjoy a calm relaxing environment given the 60% dedicated open space amenities such as clubhouse, children’s playground, fitness gym, pool, sunken pool deck and a retail arcade. Convenience, accessibility and exclusivity, MesaVerte is a place for you indeed. </span>
