  array('id' => '260','title' => 'Ground Breaking of Davao Global Township','slug' => 'ground-breaking-of-davao-global-township','content' => '<img class="size-full wp-image-2868" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8980.png" width="2048" height="1536" />Congratulations Cebu Landmasters on your 20 Hectare Davao Global Township Project Unveiling and Ceremonial Groundbreaking with Mayor Sarah Duterte😀

<img class="aligncenter size-large wp-image-2879" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8878.jpg" alt="Scale model of Davao Global Township" width="4032" height="3024" />

<img class="size-full wp-image-2872" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8990.png" width="2048" height="1152" /><img class="size-full wp-image-2874" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8989.png" width="2048" height="1536" />
<p style="text-align: justify;">"Located in the southern part of the Davao metropolis, Davao Global Township is expected to diffuse traffic in the north by pushing development to the new area which is a 30-minute drive from the Davao International Airport. The project envisioned to be Davao City’s first vibrant large-scale self-contained community with office, residential, retail and institutional uses. Its first phase covering a total gross floor area of 93,000 square meters is valued at P10 billion. It will include an office building; commercial center with an indoor mall, cineplex mall, and retail podium; residential condominium and a civic-community center– all scheduled for completion by 2021.</p>
<img class="size-full wp-image-2869" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8988.png" width="2048" height="1152" />
<p style="text-align: justify;">Upon full buildup, Davao Global Township will be an important business destination with a convention center, hotel, medical building, office buildings, and a range of residential options – from residential condominiums to townhouse style homes. “It will provide a live-work-play environment and be a modern business hub at par with the world’s best,” explained Franco Soberano, COO of Cebu Landmasters."</p>
<strong>Source: cebulandmasters.com</strong>

<img class="size-full wp-image-2873" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8987.png" width="2048" height="1152" /><img class="size-full wp-image-2870" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8986.png" width="2048" height="1152" /><img class="size-full wp-image-2871" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8985.png" width="2048" height="1152" /><img class="size-full wp-image-2875" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8984.png" width="2048" height="1152" /><img class="size-full wp-image-2878" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8983.png" width="2048" height="1152" /><img class="size-full wp-image-2876" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8982.png" width="2048" height="1152" /><img class="size-full wp-image-2877" src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/img_8981.png" width="2048" height="1152" />','excerpt' => '','featured_image' => 'blog_news/uploads/2018/11/img_8980.png','views' => '45','category_id' => '14','published_at' => '2018-11-23 15:55:07','created_at' => '2026-01-07 02:04:20','updated_at' => '2026-01-07 02:13:52'),
  array('id' => '261','title' => 'The Paragon Davao Launching at Marco Polo Hotel','slug' => 'the-paragon-davao-launching-at-marco-polo-hotel','content' => '<img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/img_0148.png" class="size-full wp-image-3551" width="1200" height="900">The Paragon Davao is one of the newest mixed development joint project of ---- and Cebu Landmasters Inc. CLI lead by their CEO Jose Soberano a true Mindanaoan ventured a High end condominium, hotel and a mall at the very historic part of Davao City.

<img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/img_0146.png" class="size-full wp-image-3549" width="1200" height="900">

The Paragon Davao officially launched last Dec ---, 2018 at the Marco Polo Hotel after the ground breaking of a --- hectare project at Matina. The used to be Davao Golf Club will be transformed into a biggest IT and entertainment hub in the Philippines.

<img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/img_0147.png" class="size-full wp-image-3550" width="1200" height="900">

The Launch was graced with talents from the entertainment industry, The Company and the Songwriter himself, Ogie Alcasid. It was a night of songs and a celebration indeed to jumpstart the project.

<img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/img_0149.jpg" class="size-full wp-image-3552" width="776" height="591">

Currently pre-selling today is One Paragon Davao, a mix use condominium project of Cebu Landmasters Inc. Contact any <a href="http://www.filipinohomes.com">Filipino Homes agent</a> today to know more about the project.','excerpt' => '','featured_image' => 'blog_news/uploads/2019/01/img_0148.png','views' => '41','category_id' => '14','published_at' => '2018-12-10 18:10:50','created_at' => '2026-01-07 02:04:20','updated_at' => '2026-01-07 02:13:52'),
