<p style="text-align: justify;">For inquiries about these projects, contact a <a href="http://filipinohomes.com/agents">Filipino Homes agent</a> now.</p>','excerpt' => 'Dumaguete City as the best place to retire in the Philippines. ','featured_image' => 'blog_news/uploads/2018/12/filipinohomes-xyzayape-realestate-ph-blogger-realtor-5.jpg','views' => '40','category_id' => '10','published_at' => '2019-02-05 03:00:54','created_at' => '2026-01-07 02:04:20','updated_at' => '2026-01-07 02:13:52'),
