<p style="text-align: justify;">Bamboo Lane is the first three-story townhouse project in Cagayan de Oro City. It is a mixed Used commercial and residential project of Pueblo de Oro Corporation. It has a provision for parking, 3 to 4 bedrooms, and 2 toilets and bath. [Read: <a href="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/bamboo-lane-groundbreaking-ceremony/">Ground Breaking of Bamboo Lane at Pueblo de Oro</a>]</p>
