<p>The&nbsp;Holy Cross Of Davao College&nbsp;(SEC-Registered) is a Filipino, Catholic, Archdiocesan and Educational Non-Profit, Non-stock Educational Corporation. It is presently supervised by the Roman Catholic Bishop of Davao (as a corporate sole) The school is governed by board of trustees whose members do not receive any compensation.</p>
