<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','excerpt' => '','featured_image' => 'blog_news/uploads/2020/01/filipino-homes-dubai.jpg','views' => '41','category_id' => '9','published_at' => '2020-01-23 17:54:00','created_at' => '2026-01-07 02:04:20','updated_at' => '2026-01-07 02:13:53'),
  array('id' => '380','title' => 'Dubai Philippine Property Roadshow 2020 a Success','slug' => 'dubai-philippine-property-roadshow-2020-a-success','content' => '<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Dubai Philippine Property Roadshow 2020 held last January 24 to 25, 2020 at Holiday Inn Bur Dubai Embassy District Dubai was a success. An overwhelming number of OFW\'s from all over the country arrived and listened to the Philippine Investment Opportunities. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"id":4875,"sizeSlug":"large"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/IMG_9052.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-4875"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Mr. Anthony Leuterio and Ms. Azela Honor of Filipino Homes talked about the current economic status and projects of the government in the Philippines. 130 Filipino Homes agents flew in from different parts of the country to help and assist in giving this wonderful news to our OFWs. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Cebu Landmasters Inc. representatives and Sales Executives were also there to give our Kababayans options on investment opportunities that are available for them. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"id":4876} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/IMG_9047-1024x768.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-4876"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I got to talk to a client andwas surprised tat how unknowledge they are about these opportunities. One of the reasons why OFW\'s have not yet invested in their home country, even if they worked for more than 7 years out of the country, it is because of the wrong perception that investing is expensive and wouldn\'t fit in their budget. maybe they were offered a high price once and backed out. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"id":4877} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/IMG_9054.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-4877"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Another client also shared how happy they were that Filipino Homes did the extra mile. Events such as the Philippine Property Roadshow help educate OFWs on how they should value their money and their hard work. Filipino Homes extended a hand for Filipino Overseas Workers to better understand real estate investing in the Philippines. Events like this will also help them manage their earnings. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"id":4878,"sizeSlug":"large"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/IMG_9053.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-4878"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Watch out for our next Philippine Property Roadshow. Like and Follow us in our Facebook Page for future announcements or contact your trusted Filipino Homes Agent. </p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','excerpt' => '','featured_image' => 'blog_news/uploads/2020/02/filipino-homes-xyza-yape-real-estate-agent-.jpg','views' => '43','category_id' => '9','published_at' => '2020-02-02 18:30:00','created_at' => '2026-01-07 02:04:20','updated_at' => '2026-01-07 02:13:53'),
  array('id' => '381','title' => 'Filipino Homes Bags Top Awards in the 7th Annual Grand Land Awards Night','slug' => 'filipino-homes-top-awards-7th-annual-grand-land-awards-night','content' => '<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Filipino Homes, the largest comprehensive real estate solutions portal in the Philippines gets recognized during the 7th Annual Grand Land Awards Night. Held at City Sports Club, Ayala Center, Cebu. The best of the real estate industry were given the high recognition including Filipino Homes.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"id":4940,"sizeSlug":"large"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/86872485_10216388129598566_5414383129370558464_n.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-4940"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Ryan Go, President of Grand Land and multi-awarded (Lamudi, PropertyGuru, DotProperty) top real estate developer in Cebu and Davao recognized Filipino Homes as the Top Realty for Grand Amani Mactan, Grand Residences and also as the 2019 Top Realty of the Year. Talented Filipino Homes real estate agent, Jane Platil was also awarded as Promising Seller of the Year by The Grand Land.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Anthony Leuterio, "<em>We are proud to represent your exciting real estate projects and we look forward to selling more units from your inventory</em>" as Filipino Homes continues to provide one-stop-shop services for real estate buyers and sellers gets recognized by one of the top real estate developer in the country.</p>
