<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:gallery {"ids":[5034,5035,5036,5037,5038,5039]} -->
<figure class="wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped"><ul class="blocks-gallery-grid"><li class="blocks-gallery-item"><figure><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/37B6FB94-E56F-4987-9DBD-B074954F0C7E_1_201_a-1024x768.jpeg" alt="" data-id="5034" data-link="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/?attachment_id=5034" class="wp-image-5034"/></figure></li><li class="blocks-gallery-item"><figure><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/22842DE3-337A-41E0-9300-F1B82A79BAA0_1_201_a-1024x768.jpeg" alt="" data-id="5035" data-link="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/?attachment_id=5035" class="wp-image-5035"/></figure></li><li class="blocks-gallery-item"><figure><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/B522645C-B21D-4562-A7EF-49C11A0E8C62-1-1024x768.jpeg" alt="" data-id="5036" data-link="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/?attachment_id=5036" class="wp-image-5036"/></figure></li><li class="blocks-gallery-item"><figure><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/D594397C-760A-4897-AE81-1EEA56637E27_1_201_a-1024x768.jpeg" alt="" data-id="5037" data-full-url="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/D594397C-760A-4897-AE81-1EEA56637E27_1_201_a-scaled.jpeg" data-link="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/?attachment_id=5037" class="wp-image-5037"/></figure></li><li class="blocks-gallery-item"><figure><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/B522645C-B21D-4562-A7EF-49C11A0E8C62-2-1024x768.jpeg" alt="" data-id="5038" data-full-url="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/B522645C-B21D-4562-A7EF-49C11A0E8C62-2.jpeg" data-link="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/?attachment_id=5038" class="wp-image-5038"/></figure></li><li class="blocks-gallery-item"><figure><img src="http://localhost:3001/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2A75C6C5-C5DD-4AF6-B92A-EF6CB4307D58_1_201_a-1024x768.jpeg" alt="" data-id="5039" data-full-url="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2A75C6C5-C5DD-4AF6-B92A-EF6CB4307D58_1_201_a-scaled.jpeg" data-link="https://filipinohomes.com/blog/?attachment_id=5039" class="wp-image-5039"/></figure></li></ul></figure>
<!-- /wp:gallery -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Italpinas Development Corp IDC™ is a design driven developer of sustainable properties focused on emerging cities in the Philippines.<br>Established in 2009 by&nbsp;<strong>Arch. Romolo V. Nati</strong>, an Italian architect, and&nbsp;<strong>Atty. Jose D. Leviste, III</strong>, a Filipino lawyer. IDC™ is committed to&nbsp;<strong>environmental sustainability</strong>&nbsp;through&nbsp;<strong>elegant architectural solutions</strong>&nbsp;and trademark contemporary Italian aesthetic. Its focus is on hyper-prospective emerging cities and other next-wave locations in the Philippines.&nbsp;<br>With its unique design philosophy, IDC™ is committed to sustainable developments in harmony with the environment to bring value to investors, end-users, and the community.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
